{"id":66672,"date":"2026-09-03T23:59:12","date_gmt":"2026-09-03T22:59:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/thryv-hyrox-simulation-set\/"},"modified":"2026-09-06T12:59:42","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T11:59:42","slug":"thryv-hyrox-simulation-set","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/thryv-hyrox-simulation-set\/","title":{"rendered":"Thryv HYROX Simulation &#8211; Set 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Thryv HYROX Simulation &#8211; Set 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Thryv HYROX Simulation &#8211; Set 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no complexo <strong>Timex Park<\/strong>, localizado na <strong>Charneca da Caparica<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Almada<\/strong>. Promovido pelo <strong>Thryv Project<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Hyrox Training Portugal<\/strong>, este evento oferece a oportunidade de vivenciar a intensidade e os standards de uma competi\u00e7\u00e3o internacional HYROX, integrando segmentos de corrida e esta\u00e7\u00f5es de treino funcional de alta exig\u00eancia f\u00edsica.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o segue rigorosamente a estrutura oficial com <strong>8 x 1 km de corrida exterior<\/strong> intercalados com <strong>8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais<\/strong>: SkiErg (1.000 m), Sled Push (50 m), Sled Pull (50 m), Burpee Broad Jump (80 m), Remo (1.000 m), Farmers Carry (200 m), Sandbag Lunges (100 m) e Wall Balls (100 repeti\u00e7\u00f5es). O evento disp\u00f5e de vagas limitadas a <strong>600 atletas<\/strong> nas categorias Open, Pro e Duplas (Masculinas, Femininas e Mistas), com partidas escalonadas em waves, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip da <strong>Lap2Go<\/strong>, refor\u00e7o de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o cont\u00ednua e o patch finisher oficial THRYV para todos os participantes que concluam o percurso.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong