r-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Doubles Women (e Women Pro)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 05 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 07:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 1 de Setembro:<\/strong> 35.00 \u20ac por atleta<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Thryv HYROX Simulation &#8211; Set 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de setembro de 2026, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do Timex Park (Rua Quinta dos Medronheiros 20, Armaz\u00e9m 3), na Charneca da Caparica, concelho de Almada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o formato de competi\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o as esta\u00e7\u00f5es?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O formato reproduz fielmente a estrutura oficial de HYROX: 8 rondas de 1 km de corrida intercaladas com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de treino funcional pela seguinte ordem: 1) SkiErg 1.000 m, 2) Sled Push 50 m, 3) Sled Pull 50 m, 4) Burpee Broad Jump 80 m, 5) Remo 1.000 m, 6) Farmers Carry 200 m, 7) Sandbag Lunges 100 m e 8) Wall Balls 100 reps.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as categorias dispon\u00edveis e como funcionam as duplas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis categorias individuais (Pro Men, Open Men, Pro Women, Open Women) e duplas (Doubles Men, Doubles Men Pro, Doubles Mixed, Doubles Women, Doubles Women Pro). Nas categorias de duplas, ambos os atletas correm os segmentos de corrida juntos e dividem o trabalho das esta\u00e7\u00f5es de treino funcional.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam os hor\u00e1rios de partida e o check-in dos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O check-in abre \u00e0s 06:00, devendo cada atleta apresentar-se 1h30 antes do seu heat (1h antes para a primeira wave). As partidas iniciam-se \u00e0s 07:00 e decorrem em waves escalonadas ao longo do dia, at\u00e9 \u00e0s 20:00, com as listas de hor\u00e1rios comunicadas previamente pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 permitido estacionar dentro do recinto do Timex Park?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">N\u00e3o. N\u00e3o \u00e9 permitido o estacionamento de viaturas de atletas ou acompanhantes no interior do Timex Park. Os participantes devem planear a sua chegada com anteced\u00eancia e estacionar nas \u00e1reas p\u00fablicas exteriores dispon\u00edveis na envolvente, respeitando o c\u00f3digo da estrada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Thryv HYROX Simulation - Set 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Timex Park, Charneca da Caparica\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Almada\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Thryv Project e Hyrox Training Portugal\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Thryv HYROX Simulation - Set 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de setembro de 2026, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do Timex Park (Rua Quinta dos Medronheiros 20, Armaz\u00e9m 3), na Charneca da Caparica, concelho de Almada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o formato de competi\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o as esta\u00e7\u00f5es?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O formato reproduz fielmente a estrutura oficial de HYROX: 8 rondas de 1 km de corrida intercaladas com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de treino funcional pela seguinte ordem: 1) SkiErg 1.000 m, 2) Sled Push 50 m, 3) Sled Pull 50 m, 4) Burpee Broad Jump 80 m, 5) Remo 1.000 m, 6) Farmers Carry 200 m, 7) Sandbag Lunges 100 m e 8) Wall Balls 100 reps.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as categorias dispon\u00edveis e como funcionam as duplas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis categorias individuais (Pro Men, Open Men, Pro Women, Open Women) e duplas (Doubles Men, Doubles Men Pro, Doubles Mixed, Doubles Women, Doubles Women Pro). Nas categorias de duplas, ambos os atletas correm os segmentos de corrida juntos e dividem o trabalho das esta\u00e7\u00f5es de treino funcional.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam os hor\u00e1rios de partida e o check-in dos atletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O check-in abre \u00e0s 06:00, devendo cada atleta apresentar-se 1h30 antes do seu heat (1h antes para a primeira wave). As partidas iniciam-se \u00e0s 07:00 e decorrem em waves escalonadas ao longo do dia, at\u00e9 \u00e0s 20:00, com as listas de hor\u00e1rios comunicadas previamente pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 permitido estacionar dentro do recinto do Timex Park?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"N\u00e3o. N\u00e3o \u00e9 permitido o estacionamento de viaturas de atletas ou acompanhantes no interior do Timex Park. Os participantes devem planear a sua chegada com anteced\u00eancia e estacionar nas \u00e1reas p\u00fablicas exteriores dispon\u00edveis na envolvente, respeitando o c\u00f3digo da estrada.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66673,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,1455],"event_type_2":[728,820,48],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-66672","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-almada-setubal","event_type-corrida","event_type-hyrox","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-setubal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/thryv-hyrox-simulation-set-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66672","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=66672"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66672\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":66674,"href":"ht